#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Hänvisningar"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid ""
"The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows "
"AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For "
"OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: "
"<i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD "
"provides an alternative syntax: "
"<i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as "
"\"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" "
"represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is "
"particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require"
" Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr ""
"Syntaxen för ”Distinguished Name” (DN) kan användas för att ange "
"användaridentitet i både OpenLDAP och Windows AD. I OpenLDAP kan formatet "
"till exempel vara "
"<i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. I Windows AD "
"kan du använda <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, även kallat "
"”userPrincipalName” (UPN). Här står ”&lt;username&gt;” för användarnamnet "
"som anges vid inloggning. Detta är särskilt relevant i läget ”Ingen sökning”"
" eller när gruppmedlemskap krävs."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Kräv gruppmedlemskap"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid ""
"Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be "
"set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause "
"authentication failure."
msgstr ""
"Kräv att användaren är medlem i gruppen för att autentiseras. "
"Gruppinställningarna måste anges; annars misslyckas autentiseringen."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Gruppens unika namn (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Det unika namnet på gruppen som användaren måste vara medlem i."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Attribut för gruppmedlem"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid ""
"Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined"
" Group Member Attribute."
msgstr ""
"Anger om det definierade gruppmedlemsattributet innehåller användarnas "
"fullständiga unika namn eller endast deras användarnamn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Unikt namn"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Unikt namn för sökning (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid ""
"Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Unikt namn för bindning till LDAP-katalogen vid specifik sökning."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Lösenord för sökning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site."
" This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Serveradressen som används i länkar till Cacti-webbplatsen. Ta med "
"underkatalogen om Cacti inte körs från rotkatalogen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Meddela primäradministratören om problem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "E-posttjänster"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "E-posttjänsten som ska användas för att skicka e-post"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Pinga e-postservern innan ett testmeddelande skickas?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "E-postadressen som ska visas som avsändare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Namnet som ska visas som avsändare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is "
"automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr ""
"Antalet tecken innan en rad i e-postmeddelandet automatiskt radbryts mellan "
"ord. (0 = inaktiverat)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Sendmail-alternativ"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Sökväg till Sendmail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For "
"failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr ""
"Värdnamnet eller IP-adressen till SMTP-servern som e-post skickas till. "
"Separera flera värdar med semikolon för reservdrift."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP-användarnamn"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you"
" do not require authentication.)"
msgstr ""
"Användarnamnet för autentisering vid sändning via SMTP. (Lämna tomt om "
"autentisering inte krävs.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP-lösenord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you"
" do not require authentication.)"
msgstr ""
"Lösenordet för autentisering vid sändning via SMTP. (Lämna tomt om "
"autentisering inte krävs.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Ange tidsgränsen för SMTP i sekunder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Förval för rapportering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Förvalt bildformat för grafer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline "
"graphs."
msgstr "Bildformatet som ska användas för inbäddade grafer i nya rapporter."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "Loggningsnivå för insamlaren vid Cacti-rapportering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in "
"any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Detaljnivån för loggfilen. VARNING: Andra nivåer än NONE eller LOW kan "
"snabbt fylla diskutrymmet."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Aktivera anpassning för Lotus Notes (R)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera kodanpassning för särskild hantering av e-postklienter för Lotus "
"Notes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar för RRD-uppdatering på begäran"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this "
"change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you "
"have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr ""
"Ska Boost aktivera RRD-uppdatering på begäran i Cacti? Om du inaktiverar "
"detta träder ändringen i kraft först efter nästa insamlingscykel. "
"Inställningen måste vara aktiverad om du har fjärrinsamlare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "RRD-uppdaterare på systemnivå"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr ""
"En insamlingskörning måste alltid slutföras innan RRD-uppdatering på begäran"
" kan rensas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Hur ofta ska Boost uppdatera alla RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are "
"requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr ""
"När Boost är aktiverat uppdateras RRD-filerna endast när en användare begär "
"dem eller när detta tidsintervall har gått ut."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Antal Boost-processer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Högsta antal poster"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take"
" place."
msgstr ""
"En uppdatering sker om antalet poster i Boosts utdatatabell överstiger denna"
" gräns."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Högsta antal datakällobjekt per omgång"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data "
"Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set "
"too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  "
"If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this "
"number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr ""
"För att optimera prestandan behöver Boosts RRD-uppdaterare veta hur många "
"datakällobjekt som ska hämtas per omgång. Ett för högt värde kan försämra "
"grafvisningen under större uppdateringar. Sänk värdet om grafvisning eller "
"datainsamling blir långsam under uppdateringar. Standardvärdet är 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Minnesgräns för Boost och insamlaren"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Maximal minnesmängd för Cactis och Boosts insamlare"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maximal körtid för RRD-uppdateringsskript"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the "
"cacti log,"
msgstr ""
"Om Boost-insamlaren överskrider denna körtid skrivs en varning till Cactis "
"logg,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Aktivera direkt infogning i tabellen poller_output_boost"

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Bildcachning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Ska bildcachning aktiveras?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files"
" will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr ""
"Ange var Boost ska placera bildfilerna. Insamlaren tar automatiskt bort "
"filerna när de har upphört att gälla."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Datakällstatistik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Aktivera insamling av datakällstatistik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Antal DSStats-processer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of "
"the Data Sources."
msgstr "Antalet samtidiga DSStats-processer som ska bearbeta alla datakällor."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Hur ofta ska daglig statistik uppdateras?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Tidsfönster för timmedelvärde"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format"
" is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr ""
"Vilken tid på dagen ska vecko-, månads- och årsdata uppdateras? Formatet är "
"HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Kontroll av RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Aktivera kontroll av RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Ska kontroll av RRD-filer aktiveras för detta Cacti-system?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Antal processer för kontroll av RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process "
"all of rrd files."
msgstr "Antalet samtidiga processer som ska kontrollera alla RRD-filer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Kontrollfrekvens"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should RRD be checked ?"
msgstr "Hur ofta ska RRD-filer kontrolleras?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar för datalagring"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external "
"RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Välj om RRD-filer ska lagras lokalt eller hanteras av en extern RRDtool-"
"proxyserver."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Strukturera sökvägar till RRD-filer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Aktivera strukturerade sökvägar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Katalogmönster"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "Enhets-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Enhets-ID/datafråge-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Enhetshash/enhets-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Enhetshash/enhets-ID/datafråge-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA-fingeravtryck"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is "
"required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr ""
"Fingeravtrycket för den offentliga RSA-nyckel som proxyn använder. Det krävs"
" för att upprätta en betrodd anslutning."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool-proxyserver för reservdrift"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread "
"all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr ""
"Om både den primära proxyn och reservproxyn är tillgängliga fördelar detta "
"alternativ RRDtool-begäranden mellan dem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. "
"This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr ""
"Fingeravtrycket för den offentliga RSA-nyckel som reservproxyn använder. Det"
" krävs för att upprätta en betrodd anslutning."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Borttagningsmetod"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Variansbaserad med avvikande värden borttagna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike "
"with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces"
" the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known "
"good value found."
msgstr ""
"Det finns tre ersättningsmetoder. Den första ersätter toppen med datakällans"
" medelvärde. Den andra ersätter den med ”NaN”. Den sista ersätter den med "
"det senast kända giltiga värdet."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN-värden"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Senast kända giltiga värde"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d standardavvikelser"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once "
"outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance "
"Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample "
"above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr ""
"Värdet anger procentandelen över det justerade medelvärdet efter att "
"avvikande mätvärden har tagits bort. Om variansprocenten är 100%% och det "
"justerade medelvärdet är 50 tas exempelvis alla mätvärden över 100 bort från"
" grafen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Antal avvikande värden för variansberäkning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be "
"removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If "
"you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages "
"are removed."
msgstr ""
"Antalet höga respektive låga medelvärden som tas bort innan "
"variansmedelvärdet beräknas. Om du väljer 5 tas de fem högsta och fem lägsta"
" medelvärdena bort."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d höga/låga mätvärden"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Högsta antal borttagningar per RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph "
"RRA."
msgstr "Högsta antalet toppar som ska tas bort från en grafs RRA."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "%d toppar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Inställningar för satsvis borttagning av toppar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Schema för borttagning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am'"
" and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately"
" midnight every day."
msgstr ""
"Bastiden för borttagning av toppar. Om du till exempel anger ”12:00am” och "
"väljer en gång per dag börjar den satsvisa borttagningen omkring midnatt "
"varje dag."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Templates to Spike Kill"
msgstr "Grafmallar för borttagning av toppar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will "
"be acted on."
msgstr ""
"Vid satsvis borttagning av toppar används endast mallarna som valts nedan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select Template(s)"
msgstr "Välj mallar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Backup Retention"
msgstr "Lagringstid för säkerhetskopior"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"When SpikeKill kills spikes in graphs, it makes a backup of the RRDfile.  "
"How long should these backup files be retained?"
msgstr ""
"När SpikeKill tar bort toppar i grafer säkerhetskopieras RRD-filen. Hur "
"länge ska säkerhetskopiorna sparas?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TimeZone Support"
msgstr "Stöd för tidszoner"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "My Browsers Timezone"
msgstr "Min webbläsares tidszon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Graph Title"
msgstr "Visa graftitel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Disabled"
msgstr "Dölj inaktiverade"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hides Disabled Devices and Graphs when viewing outside of Console tab."
msgstr "Döljer inaktiverade enheter och grafer utanför konsolfliken."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"If a Device Data Source is included in an Aggregate Graph, show that Graph "
"along with other Device Graphs"
msgstr ""
"Om en enhets datakälla ingår i en aggregatgraf visas grafen tillsammans med "
"enhetens övriga grafer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Enable Horizontal Scrolling of Tables, Disabling Responsive Column "
"Visibility."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera horisontell rullning i tabeller och inaktivera responsiv "
"kolumnvisning."
